  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4102.03 Suspension or Revocation of Certification for Additional Truck Weights",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-09-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4102.03 Suspension or Revocation of Certification for Additional Truck Weights.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 266:18-d, VI, the commissioner shall, after notice and an opportunity for a hearing, suspend or revoke the certification for additional truck weights for any vehicle which has more than one violation of RSA 266:18-a-d, as applicable, during a calendar year as evidenced by a record of convictions for those violations.\n\n(b) The length of the suspension or revocation shall depend upon the number of convictions for violations of RSA 266:18-a-d that occur during a calendar year.\n\n(c) The commissioner shall impose the following:\n\n(1) For 2 convictions, a period of suspension not to exceed 30 days; or\n\n(2) For 3 or more convictions, a period of revocation not to exceed the remainder of the period for which the certification was issued and denial of reapplication for an additional year, if the convictions warrant.\n\nSource. #4193, eff 12-30-86; amd by #4251, eff 3-31-87, EXPIRED 3-31-93\n\nNew. #5628, eff 5-25-93; ss by #6946, eff 2-25-99, EXPIRED: 2-25-07\n\nNew. #8881, INTERIM, eff 5-3-07, EXPIRES: 10-30-07; ss by #9000, eff 9-29-07, EXPIRED: 9-29-15\n\nNew. #11050, INTERIM, eff 3-5-16, EXPIRED: 9-1-16 (from Saf-C 4102.04)\n\nNew. #11190, eff 9-22-16",
